{"page":7,"width":1956,"height":2629,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"자료구조와 알고리즘","words":[{"text":"자료구조와","x":437,"y":193,"width":353,"height":81},{"text":"알고리즘","x":817,"y":193,"width":275,"height":80}]},{"text":"1.1 자료구조와 알고리즘","words":[{"text":"1.1","x":436,"y":617,"width":54,"height":50},{"text":"자료구조와","x":512,"y":615,"width":250,"height":56},{"text":"알고리즘","x":777,"y":615,"width":191,"height":56}]},{"text":"자료구조란?","words":[{"text":"자료구조란?","x":433,"y":768,"width":221,"height":45}]},{"text":"[그림 1-1]에서 보듯이 우리는 일상생횔에서 시물들을 정리하는 여러 가지 방법을 이용하고 있다.","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":433,"y":845,"width":63,"height":31},{"text":"1-1]에서","x":509,"y":846,"width":111,"height":35},{"text":"보듯이","x":635,"y":846,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"우리는","x":737,"y":847,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"일상생횔에서","x":842,"y":845,"width":176,"height":36},{"text":"시물들을","x":1033,"y":846,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"정리하는","x":1168,"y":846,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":1304,"y":848,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"가지","x":1378,"y":849,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"방법을","x":1452,"y":848,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"이용하고","x":1557,"y":848,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1696,"y":847,"width":68,"height":35}]},{"text":"비것 리스트에는 우리가 평생에 이루고 싶은 목표를 차례대로 기록한다. 식당에서는 그릇들을","words":[{"text":"비것","x":433,"y":902,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"리스트에는","x":512,"y":904,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"우리가","x":680,"y":905,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"평생에","x":787,"y":905,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"이루고","x":893,"y":905,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"싶은","x":997,"y":905,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"목표를","x":1071,"y":907,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"차례대로","x":1178,"y":906,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"기록한다.","x":1320,"y":907,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"식당에서는","x":1470,"y":907,"width":156,"height":34},{"text":"그릇들을","x":1640,"y":905,"width":128,"height":36}]},{"text":"쌓아서 보관한다. 마트에서 계산을 할 때는 차례대로 줄을 선다. 영어사전에는 단어들과 단어들","words":[{"text":"쌓아서","x":431,"y":960,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"보관한다.","x":538,"y":962,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"마트에서","x":686,"y":963,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"계산을","x":821,"y":963,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":922,"y":963,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"때는","x":965,"y":963,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"차례대로","x":1038,"y":963,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"줄을","x":1172,"y":965,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"선다.","x":1248,"y":965,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"영어사전에는","x":1335,"y":966,"width":185,"height":34},{"text":"단어들과","x":1532,"y":965,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"단어들","x":1670,"y":964,"width":96,"height":34}]},{"text":"의 설명이 저장되어 있다. 컴퓨터는 계층적인 디렉터리를 이용하여 피필들을 저장한다. 지도에","words":[{"text":"의","x":432,"y":1018,"width":27,"height":33},{"text":"설명이","x":477,"y":1018,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"저장되어","x":585,"y":1020,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":722,"y":1021,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"컴퓨터는","x":806,"y":1021,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"계층적인","x":941,"y":1021,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리를","x":1076,"y":1022,"width":153,"height":34},{"text":"이용하여","x":1243,"y":1023,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"피필들을","x":1380,"y":1023,"width":124,"height":33},{"text":"저장한다.","x":1518,"y":1023,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"지도에","x":1669,"y":1022,"width":92,"height":35}]},{"text":"는 도시들과 도시들을 연결하는 도로가 표시되어 있다.","words":[{"text":"는","x":430,"y":1077,"width":33,"height":31},{"text":"도시들과","x":473,"y":1077,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"도시들을","x":608,"y":1078,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"연결하는","x":743,"y":1079,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"도로가","x":872,"y":1080,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"표시되어","x":974,"y":1081,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1109,"y":1081,"width":65,"height":34}]},{"text":"큐의 끝","words":[{"text":"큐의","x":701,"y":1472,"width":36,"height":19},{"text":"끝","x":745,"y":1472,"width":18,"height":19}]},{"text":"큐의 처음","words":[{"text":"큐의","x":949,"y":1475,"width":36,"height":19},{"text":"처음","x":994,"y":1475,"width":36,"height":19}]},{"text":"[그림 1-1] 일상생활에서의 사물의 조직화","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":432,"y":1542,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"1-1]","x":503,"y":1543,"width":47,"height":30},{"text":"일상생활에서의","x":569,"y":1545,"width":164,"height":27},{"text":"사물의","x":742,"y":1545,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"조직화","x":823,"y":1548,"width":72,"height":26}]},{"text":"사람들이 시끌을 정리하여 저장하는 것과 마찬가지로 프로그램에서도 자료들을 정리하여 보","words":[{"text":"사람들이","x":467,"y":1659,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"시끌을","x":603,"y":1660,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"정리하여","x":706,"y":1660,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"저장하는","x":839,"y":1661,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"것과","x":971,"y":1661,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"마찬가지로","x":1043,"y":1661,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램에서도","x":1208,"y":1663,"width":220,"height":33},{"text":"자료들을","x":1441,"y":1663,"width":124,"height":33},{"text":"정리하여","x":1579,"y":1664,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"보","x":1716,"y":1664,"width":30,"height":27}]},{"text":"관하는 여러 가지 구조들이 있다. 이를 자료 구조(data structure)라 부른다. 몇 가지의 예를 들","words":[{"text":"관하는","x":433,"y":1716,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"여러","x":538,"y":1717,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":611,"y":1718,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"구조들이","x":681,"y":1719,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":814,"y":1719,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"이를","x":895,"y":1719,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"자료","x":964,"y":1718,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"구조(data","x":1037,"y":1719,"width":135,"height":34},{"text":"structure)라","x":1185,"y":1720,"width":179,"height":34},{"text":"부른다.","x":1375,"y":1720,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"몇","x":1494,"y":1721,"width":26,"height":32},{"text":"가지의","x":1536,"y":1721,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"예를","x":1642,"y":1721,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"들","x":1719,"y":1721,"width":22,"height":31}]},{"text":"어보면 식당에서 그릇을 쌓는 것처럼 자료들을 쌓아서 정리하는 구조를 컴퓨터에서는 “스택”이","words":[{"text":"어보면","x":435,"y":1774,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"식당에서","x":539,"y":1775,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"그릇을","x":672,"y":1776,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"쌓는","x":773,"y":1776,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"것처럼","x":847,"y":1776,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"자료들을","x":946,"y":1775,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"쌓아서","x":1080,"y":1776,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"정리하는","x":1187,"y":1776,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"구조를","x":1321,"y":1779,"width":94,"height":31},{"text":"컴퓨터에서는","x":1430,"y":1777,"width":184,"height":34},{"text":"“스택”이","x":1627,"y":1776,"width":114,"height":34}]},{"text":"라고 부른다. 스택에서는 맨 위에서만 자료를 추가하거나 제거할 수 있다. 마트 계산대의 줄에","words":[{"text":"라고","x":435,"y":1831,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"부른다.","x":508,"y":1832,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"스택에서는","x":624,"y":1833,"width":148,"height":33},{"text":"맨","x":786,"y":1833,"width":28,"height":32},{"text":"위에서만","x":830,"y":1833,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"자료를","x":960,"y":1832,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"추가하거나","x":1062,"y":1833,"width":154,"height":33},{"text":"제거할","x":1231,"y":1834,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":1336,"y":1835,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":1383,"y":1835,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"마트","x":1468,"y":1835,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"계산대의","x":1545,"y":1835,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"줄에","x":1680,"y":1833,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"해당하는 자료 구조를 우리는 큐라 부른다. 큐에서는 먼저 도착한 자료가 먼저 빠져나간다. 〈표","words":[{"text":"해당하는","x":434,"y":1888,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"자료","x":569,"y":1888,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"구조를","x":641,"y":1891,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"우리는","x":742,"y":1890,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"큐라","x":844,"y":1891,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"부른다.","x":916,"y":1889,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"큐에서는","x":1028,"y":1890,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"먼저","x":1165,"y":1891,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"도착한","x":1237,"y":1891,"width":94,"height":32},{"text":"자료가","x":1344,"y":1891,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"먼저","x":1451,"y":1891,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"빠져나간다.","x":1524,"y":1891,"width":160,"height":35},{"text":"〈표","x":1702,"y":1893,"width":39,"height":29}]},{"text":"1-1〉에 일상생활과 컴퓨터에서 시용되는 자료구조를 叩고하였다.","words":[{"text":"1-1〉에","x":434,"y":1944,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"일상생활과","x":531,"y":1944,"width":148,"height":34},{"text":"컴퓨터에서","x":691,"y":1945,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"시용되는","x":847,"y":1947,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"자료구조를","x":976,"y":1946,"width":151,"height":34},{"text":"叩고하였다.","x":1139,"y":1947,"width":157,"height":34}]},{"text":"12 C언어로 쉽게 풀어쓴 자료구조","words":[{"text":"12","x":153,"y":2457,"width":36,"height":27},{"text":"C언어로","x":218,"y":2457,"width":84,"height":24},{"text":"쉽게","x":311,"y":2456,"width":43,"height":25},{"text":"풀어쓴","x":363,"y":2457,"width":68,"height":24},{"text":"자료구조","x":438,"y":2458,"width":92,"height":24}]}]}